<title>POLAND: BETON STAL APPOINTS NEW PRESIDENT.</title>
<headline>BETON STAL APPOINTS NEW PRESIDENT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction firm Beton Stal SA appointed Jacek Lesniewski for president from October 1, 1996 to September 30, 1999, the firm said in a statement, giving no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
